From: Androlinzberg maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] GLES: release the original JNI heap-buffer array pointer

The pinned generated bindings offset heap-backed NIO pointers for GL, but
release that interior pointer as if JNI had returned it. Preserve the
original pointer on release and do not release an array that was never
acquired. Stop on a failed array acquisition before applying its offset.
Java API sources remain unchanged.

diff --git a/core/jni/android_opengl_GLES20.cpp b/core/jni/android_opengl_GLES20.cpp
--- a/core/jni/android_opengl_GLES20.cpp
+++ b/core/jni/android_opengl_GLES20.cpp
